  {"i":1064,"t":["media","law"],"s":{"2":["science"]},"n":"Learners meet 発生 in news of accidents, fires and outbreaks (emergencies); generation of heat/power is a separate science sense; not a describing word"},
  {"i":1068,"t":["time","media"],"n":"Used for telling about past happenings (今日の出来事) and for incidents in the news; time first, media second"},
  {"i":1071,"t":["money","time","measures"],"n":"Charge (電気代) is money, era/generation is time, and the decade counter (20代) is a very common counter"},
  {"i":1135,"t":["work","sports"],"n":"Professional is a work word, and learners meet it constantly in sport (プロ野球, プロの選手)"},
  {"i":1155,"t":["time"],"n":"だんだん is learned as 'gradually'; the stairs/terrace sense is rare for learners"}
